    <div class="forum-container">
        <h1>Forum</h1>
        <section id="thread-list">
            <h2>Discussion Threads</h2>
            {% for thread in threads %}
                <div class="thread">
                    <h3><a href="{{ url_for('view_thread', thread_id=thread.thread_id) }}">{{ thread.thread_title }}</a></h3>
                    <p>{{ thread.thread_content }}</p>
                    <p><strong>Posted by:</strong> {{ thread.username }}</p>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </section>
        <div>
            <h2>Create a New Thread</h2>
            <form action="{{ url_for('create_thread') }}" method="post">
                <label for="thread-title-input">Thread Title:</label>
                <input type="text" id="thread-title-input" name="thread_title" required>
                <label for="thread-content-area">Thread Content:</label>
                <textarea id="thread-content-area" name="thread_content" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" id="submit-thread-button">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

view_thread.html
```html
'''
This is the view thread page for the ParentingAdviceForum web application.
It displays the title and content of a specific discussion thread along with comments and a comment submission area.
'''
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>View Thread</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='css/styles.css') }}">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="view-thread-container">
        <h1 id="view-thread-title">{{ thread.title }}</h1>
        <div id="view-thread-content">{{ thread.content }}</div>
        <section id="comments-section">
            <h2>Comments</h2>
            {% for comment in comments %}
                <div class="comment">
                    <p>{{ comment.comment_content }}</p>
                    <p><strong>Posted by:</strong> {{ comment.username }}</p>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </section>
        <div>
            <label for="comment-input-area">Add a Comment:</label>
            <textarea id="comment-input-area" name="comment_content" required></textarea>
            <form action="{{ url_for('submit_comment', thread_id=thread_id) }}" method="post">
                <button id="submit-comment-button" type="submit">Submit Comment</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

